  "description": "At ISSEI Dubai, indulge in artfully crafted dishes that celebrate the bold flavors of Nikkei cuisine—where Peruvian ingredients like aji, yellow peppers, Andes potatoes, and corn meet the delicate finesse of Japanese elements such as miso, ginger, soy, wasabi, and rice vinegar. Complement your culinary journey with our curated selection of signature cocktails, perfect for sipping as you soak in the Latin vibes and stunning views. Whether you're here for the food, the drinks, or the atmosphere, ISSEI offers a vibrant and unforgettable experience that ignites all the senses.",
